inkstack --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `inkstack fork`, `inkstack exec`, and `inkstack exec fork`
inkstack fork --worktree: `inkstack fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
inkstack fork --worktree --last: `inkstack fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
inkstack exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `inkstack exec fork --worktree`
inkstack exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
inkstack resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `inkstack fork`, `inkstack exec`, and `inkstack exec fork`
inkstack archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `inkstack fork`, `inkstack exec`, and `inkstack exec fork`
inkstack queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `inkstack fork`, `inkstack exec`, and `inkstack exec fork`
